# DOJOFLOW – WORLD-CLASS MARTIAL ARTS ACADEMY MANAGEMENT PLATFORM
## Complete Application Upgrade, UI/UX Transformation, Firebase Architecture & Production Implementation

You are now acting as a principal software architect, senior Flutter/web application engineer, Firebase specialist, product designer and QA engineer.

Your assignment is to transform the existing DojoFLOW application into a polished, scalable, production-ready Martial Arts Academy Management Platform.

This is NOT a request to create a prototype, static UI, mockup or fresh demonstration application.

You are working on an EXISTING APPLICATION with an existing Firebase project, Google Authentication, organisation setup, dojo management, students, attendance, fees, schedules, tournaments and belt progression functionality.

Your first responsibility is to inspect the existing codebase and understand its current architecture.

Then systematically improve it.

# THE PRODUCT VISION

DojoFLOW is a comprehensive management platform for martial arts academies, karate federations and multi-location training organisations.

It should work for:
- An individual Sensei operating one small dojo.
- A Shihan managing multiple branches.
- A Top Sensei administering a national federation.
- An international martial arts organisation operating across countries.
- Future parents monitoring their children's martial arts journey.

Our philosophy:

"Manage your Dojo. Develop your Students. Build your Legacy."

The application must be intuitive enough for a Sensei with limited technical knowledge and powerful enough for a large martial arts federation.

Prioritise mobile usability, simple workflows, regional language readiness and reliable data management.

