## LEVEL 2 – SHIHAN

Second-level instructor and assigned dojo administrator.

Can:
- Access assigned dojos only.
- Manage students in assigned dojos.
- Add and edit student records.
- Archive inactive students.
- Create class schedules.
- Manage class announcements.
- Mark and manage attendance.
